OL,3,ANinth woman's body found as South
OL,4,AAfrican police investigate string of
OL,5,Adeaths
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice in South Africa have confirmed
OL,8,Fthe discovery of a ninth woman's body
OL,9,Fin just two months, amid growing
OL,10,Fconcern over a string of unexplained
OL,11,Fdeaths east of Johannesburg.
OL,13,FThe latest victim was found half-naked
OL,14,Fand wrapped in a sheet on the side of a
OL,15,Froad in Dawn Park on Thursday morning,
OL,16,Fpolice said. Her identity has not yet
OL,17,Fbeen released.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
